    <item>
        <title><![CDATA[How accurate is the counting?]]></title>
        <pubDate>2026-10-30 01:47:18</pubDate>
        <dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
        <description></description>
        <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>FootfallCam uses 3D stereo vision rather than simple beam-break or Wi-Fi tracking, which means it can distinguish between adults and children, exclude staff, and count people walking side by side as separate visitors. Vendor-published accuracy is above 95% under normal retail conditions. In practice, accuracy depends heavily on correct mounting height and positioning, which is why we handle installation planning as part of the deployment.</p>]]></content:encoded>
        <wp:post_id>20010</wp:post_id>
        <wp:post_date>2026-10-30 01:47:18</wp:post_date>
        <wp:post_date_gmt>2026-10-30 01:47:18</wp:post_date_gmt>
        <wp:comment_status>closed</wp:comment_status>
        <wp:ping_status>closed</wp:ping_status>
        <wp:post_name><![CDATA[faq-10]]></wp:post_name>
        <wp:status>publish</wp:status>
        <wp:post_parent>0</wp:post_parent>
        <wp:menu_order>10</wp:menu_order>
        <wp:post_type>ufaq</wp:post_type>
        <wp:is_sticky>0</wp:is_sticky>
        <category domain="ufaq-category" nicename="footfallcam"><![CDATA[FootfallCam]]></category>
    </item>
    <item>
        <title><![CDATA[Does it use facial recognition?]]></title>
        <pubDate>2026-10-30 01:47:18</pubDate>
        <dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
        <description></description>
        <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>No. The system counts people as anonymous objects and does not store images or identify individuals. This is an important distinction for compliance, because it means the deployment generally sits outside the scope of personal data collection under Singapore's PDPA, Malaysia's PDPA, Thailand's PDPA, and Indonesia's PDP Law.</p>]]></content:encoded>
        <wp:post_id>20011</wp:post_id>
        <wp:post_date>2026-10-30 01:47:18</wp:post_date>
        <wp:post_date_gmt>2026-10-30 01:47:18</wp:post_date_gmt>
