    <item>
        <title><![CDATA[What do we need on site to run it?]]></title>
        <pubDate>2026-10-30 01:47:18</pubDate>
        <dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
        <description></description>
        <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Each device requires power and a network connection, typically over PoE, so a single cable handles both. The data is uploaded to the cloud dashboard, so you need internet access at the store, though the devices buffer data locally if the connection drops and sync once it is restored. No on-premise server is needed.</p>]]></content:encoded>
        <wp:post_id>20012</wp:post_id>
        <wp:post_date>2026-10-30 01:47:18</wp:post_date>
