    </item>
    <item>
        <title><![CDATA[How many devices does a store need?]]></title>
        <pubDate>2026-10-30 01:47:18</pubDate>
        <dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
        <description></description>
        <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>It depends on the width of your entrances and whether you want zone-level analytics as well as entrance counting. A single standard entrance is usually covered by one device, while wide or double-door entrances may need more. We do a site assessment from your floor plans before quoting so the count is accurate rather than estimated.</p>]]></content:encoded>
        <wp:post_id>20013</wp:post_id>
        <wp:post_date>2026-10-30 01:47:18</wp:post_date>
