    <item>
        <title><![CDATA[Can it integrate with our POS or other systems?]]></title>
        <pubDate>2026-10-30 01:47:18</pubDate>
        <dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
        <description></description>
        <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Yes. Integrating POS transaction data is what allows the system to calculate conversion rate automatically, and data can also be exported or pushed to reporting tools your team already uses. The specific integration method depends on your POS platform, so we scope this during pre-sales.</p>]]></content:encoded>
