        <dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
        <description></description>
        <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Your stores, e-commerce and mobile channels run on one platform instead of separate systems, so stock, pricing and customer data stay consistent everywhere. That's what makes click-and-collect and ship-from-store work properly.</p>]]></content:encoded>
